<title>UK: UK M4 grows provisional 10.3 pct in year to Oct.</title>
<headline>UK M4 grows provisional 10.3 pct in year to Oct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of England published the following provisional data on UK monetary aggregates for October:</p>
<p>    MONEY SUPPLY				 OCT	   SEPT</p>
<p>    M4 in month	 (adjusted)	  +1.1	   +0.8</p>
<p>    M4 year to date   (adjusted)	 +10.3	   +9.9</p>
<p>    M4 in month	 (unadjusted)	+0.9	   +0.8</p>
<p>    M4 year to date   (unadjusted)     +10.3	   +9.8</p>
<p>Adjusted lending by banks, building</p>
<p>     societies in billions of stg	     +7.4	   +3.7</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom 44 171 542 2774</p>
</text>
